{"availability":"available","full":"AayushCharde/PlugPulseEV","name":"PlugPulseEV","description":"Community-verified EV charger reliability, open trust layer on top of the map. Freshness-weighted live status reports on Open Charge Map data.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-08T15:05:41Z","updated":"2026-07-20T07:44:56Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://plugpulse.vercel.app","topics":["community","electric-vehicles","ev-charging","fastapi","maplibre","open-charge-map","open-data","postgis","pwa","python","reliability","sveltekit","typescript"],"demo":"https://plugpulse.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T19:30:48.781Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T19:30:48.781Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T19:30:48.781Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T05:44:42.855Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T19:30:48.781Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Svelte","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Community-verified EV charger reliability — the open trust layer on top of the map.","PlugPulse doesn't just show you where EV chargers are; it tells you whether they actually work right now, using one-tap reports from the community with a freshness-weighted reliability score. Built entirely on open data and open source, so the whole ecosystem can reuse it.","Finding chargers is a solved problem — closed aggregators cover it. Trusting them isn't. Apps show stale \"availability\" from operator feeds, so drivers arrive at chargers that are broken, occupied, or blocked. No one owns an open, real-time, community-verified source of truth. PlugPulse is that layer."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AayushCharde/PlugPulseEV/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"17854ba4eb5bcb56ed6529624db9ce2048a17c7ca9796bb96d482ce4e71174b4","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:43.044Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:43.044Z","projectInsights":{"version